 Responsible AI\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: L\nSubmission t
 ype: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nN
 otes: Official WSDM 2027 pages list Hong Kong (Cordis)\, Feb 15-19\, and 
 AoE deadlines: full-paper abstract Aug 17 and paper Aug 24\, 2026 (closed
 \; notification Nov 2)\, short papers (up to 4 pages\, new work) Nov 17\,
  and doctoral consortium (single-author student packet) Nov 12\, 2026. De
 mo papers closed Oct 15\, 2026.\nScope: Web search\, ranking\, recommenda
 tion and mining of web and social data. Characteristic extensions include
  large-scale graph analysis\, conversational retrieval\, foundation-model
  and agentic web systems\, and fairness and privacy in information access
 . The broad emerging-applications inventory is not treated as evidence th
