SUMMARY:[Information Retrieval & Search][Recommender Systems] ECIR 2027 - F
 ull-paper abstract deadline (cutoff time unannounced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: European Conference on Information Retrieval\
 nWebsite: https://www.ecir2027.co.uk/\nSource URL: https://www.ecir2027.c
 o.uk/call-for-full-papers\nLocation: Southampton\, UK\nTopics: Informatio
 n Retrieval & Search\, Recommender Systems\, Natural Language Processing 
 & LLMs\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nCo
 nfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Track-specific
  calls confirm paper days but no exact cutoff hour. Full/short abstract g
 ates are already closed\; replicability and resource papers remain indepe
 ndent opportunities. Resource papers report original research resources\,
  not camera-ready work. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Informatio
 n retrieval and ranking\, recommendation\, conversational search and RAG\
 , user information interaction\, system efficiency\, and rigorous evaluat
 ion. The 2027 call explicitly includes language models and agentic retrie
 val workflows. Replicability and research-resource papers are distinct ro
 utes. Fairness and explainability concern information access rather than 
 generic responsible-AI topics.\nAdditional topics: Human-AI Interaction &
  Deployment\, Explainability & Interpretability\, Fairness & Responsible 
 AI\, Multimedia Learning & Retrieval\nScope sources (2027): https://www.e
 cir2027.co.uk/call-for-full-papers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07\nOffic
 ial deadline day\; exact cutoff hour/timezone is unannounced. Verify the 
 organizer's submission portal.
URL:https://www.ecir2027.co.uk/call-for-full-papers
